# Deliberately NO node_modules/ entry here (unlike the pattern Farstone's own build hit and
# documented in vendor/@red-cup-engineering/feltos/VENDORED.md): an unanchored `node_modules/`
# rule matches a directory with that name at ANY depth, which would silently drop
# node_modules/@red-cup-engineering/{qwzspace,arnold} — real, non-vendored dependencies this
# deploy needs shipped as-is via a plain `COPY . .` (see Dockerfile) — from the Cloud Run build
# context, exactly the failure aletheon's own Dockerfile records avoiding the same way.
.tmp/
*.log
